<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Protótipo — Cobrança / Usuários para Notificação</title>
<style>
:root{--slate1:#2D3748;--slate2:#4A5568;--border:#E2E8F0;--text:#2D3748;--muted:#6C757D;--blue:#007BFF;--wrapper:#F4F6F9;--green:#28A745;--red:#DC3545}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;font-family:'Source Sans Pro',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;background:var(--wrapper);color:var(--text)}
.wrapper{display:flex;min-height:100vh}
.main-sidebar{width:250px;flex-shrink:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#0F1823 0%,#1A2A3A 25%,#2C3E50 50%,#1A2A3A 75%,#0F1823 100%);box-shadow:2px 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,.2);color:#fff}
.brand{padding:16px 20px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);font-size:18px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,.92)}
.sidebar-nav{padding:12px 10px}
.sidebar-nav a{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px 12px;margin-bottom:2px;border-radius:8px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);text-decoration:none;font-size:13.5px}
.sidebar-nav a.active{background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.12),0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.24)}
.content-wrapper{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0}
.topbar{background:#fff;padding:9px 24px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}
.content{padding:22px 28px 40px;max-width:1080px}
.banner{background:#eef5ff;border:1px solid #bcdcff;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px;font-size:12.5px;color:#0b4a8f;margin-bottom:18px;line-height:1.55}
.banner b{color:#07396b}
.fine{font-size:11px;color:#8891a0;margin-bottom:10px;display:block}

.card{background:#fff;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.1),0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.06);overflow:hidden}
.card-header{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--slate1) 0%,var(--slate2) 100%);color:#fff;padding:13px 20px;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
.card-body{padding:20px 22px}

.toolbar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px}
.exports{display:flex;gap:8px}
.btn{border:none;border-radius:4px;padding:8px 16px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block}
.btn-sm{padding:6px 12px;font-size:12px}
.btn-primary{background:var(--blue);color:#fff}
.btn-modern{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--slate1) 0%,var(--slate2) 100%);color:#fff;font-weight:600;padding:8px 18px;border-radius:6px}
.btn-outline{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--muted)}
.btn-secondary{background:var(--muted);color:#fff}
.btn-danger{background:var(--red);color:#fff}
input[type=text]{padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;font-size:13px;font-family:inherit;color:var(--text)}

table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px}
thead th{background:#F4F6F9;color:var(--slate2);font-weight:700;text-align:left;padding:11px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);font-size:11.5px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.02em}
tbody td{padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text)}
tbody tr:hover{background:#eef5ff}
.acoes{text-align:right}
.acoes .btn{margin-left:6px}

.tablefoot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:14px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}
.pagination{display:flex;gap:6px}
.pagination button{border:1px solid var(--border);background:#fff;border-radius:6px;padding:6px 12px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text);cursor:pointer}
.pagination button.active{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrapper">
  <aside class="main-sidebar">
    <div class="brand">Serviço ao Cidadão</div>
    <div class="sidebar-nav">
      <a href="#">Dashboard</a>
      <a href="#">Assuntos</a>
      <a href="#">Tipos de Solicitação</a>
      <a href="#">SubAssuntos</a>
      <a href="#">Grupos</a>
      <a href="#">Governos</a>
      <a href="#">Órgaos</a>
      <a href="#">Pedido de Informação</a>
      <a href="#">Diretoria</a>
      <a href="#">Formulários Dinâmicos</a>
      <a href="#">Solicitações</a>
      <a href="#">Tipo Não Atendimento</a>
      <a href="#">Teleatendimento</a>
      <a class="active" href="#">Cobrança</a>
    </div>
  </aside>
  <div class="content-wrapper">
    <div class="topbar"><span>☰</span><span>Home / Cobrança</span></div>
    <div class="content">

      <div class="banner">
        <b>O que mudou:</b> apliquei o mesmo padrão visual das outras telas do sistema — sidebar, cabeçalho de card em gradiente, tabela com cabeçalho cinza claro e hover, botões "Editar"/"Excluir" no padrão já usado, e paginação numerada. O rascunho enviado usava uma paleta genérica (azul claro/cinza), então troquei pelas cores e componentes reais do LConnect.
      </div>
      <span class="fine">Protótipo — tela "Cobrança" · Lista de usuários para notificação</span>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-header">
          <span>☰ Lista de usuários para notificação</span>
          <a href="prototipo-cobranca-em-nivel.html" class="btn btn-modern">+ Novo cadastro</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">

          <div class="toolbar">
            <div class="exports">
              <button class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">CSV</button>
              <button class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">Excel</button>
              <button class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">PDF</button>
            </div>
            <div>
              <input type="text" placeholder="Buscar registros" style="width:220px">
            </div>
          </div>

          <table>
            <thead>
              <tr><th>Usuário</th><th>Órgão</th><th class="acoes">Ações</th></tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td>DENISE IELPO</td>
                <td>Secretaria Municipal de Desenvolvimento Social</td>
                <td class="acoes"><button class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm">Editar</button><button class="btn btn-danger btn-sm">Excluir</button></td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>CARLA GUIMARAES</td>
                <td>Secretaria Municipal de Administração</td>
                <td class="acoes"><button class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm">Editar</button><button class="btn btn-danger btn-sm">Excluir</button></td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>

          <div class="tablefoot">
            <span>Mostrando de 1 até 10 de 19 registros</span>
            <div class="pagination">
              <button>Anterior</button>
              <button class="active">1</button>
              <button>2</button>
              <button>Próximo</button>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
